                    <section class="blog-summary"  data-gt-id="blog_summary" data-gt-component-name="Blog Summary">
                        
                        

<div class="blog-summary__update-wrapper">
    
</div>

<div class="blog-summary__summary">
    <p data-block-key="02xur">We introduce PASTA, a reinforcement learning agent that refines text-to-image output over multiple turns of interaction with a user by learning their unique preferences. This process is made possible by a novel user simulation technique.</p>
</div>
                        
