          caption
          --center
        ">
          <p data-block-key="00pr5"><i>Starting with a simple prompt for "A white cat", PASTA engages the user in a visually grounded dialogue. The user's selections (highlighted in blue) help the agent quickly learn their preference for a more fantastical and colorful style.</i></p>
